{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_01",
  "title": "倒懸蒼白海上",
  "storyCode": "EP-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7272369f8f4a0020e175bd20e396942bb699827aec17f714c07ca1ce224530f0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喲，帕斯卡拉，你終於來了。我還以為你死在鹽漠裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看你這張慘白的小臉，路上遇到什麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "閉嘴，蒂奇……快點讓我進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "想進來？首領要的東西你拿到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當然，不只羅盤，我還有另外一個大發現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "胡安娜女士一直在找的煉金術師，我也有線索了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在我能進去了嗎，蒂奇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當然，神偷帕斯卡拉小姐，您的光臨讓寒舍蓬蓽生輝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "升起船帆嘿，收起船錨嘿♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "讓狂風撕扯我們的衣衫♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "讓暴雨澆醒我們的酒意♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "準備！出發！港口的船有千千萬萬隻！♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天亮我們將第一個衝向大♪……\n啊啊——你是誰？！為什麼會蹲在我家？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老伯，這條小巷……是你家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小夥子，你現在頂的紙板就是我的床……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對不起，我看它在垃圾桶旁邊，以為沒人要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我能在你家暫時躲雨嗎？天亮我就離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "鎮上已經兩個月沒下過一滴雨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就算要下雨，你能不能先放下我的床？喏，這是我的被子，你拿去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……謝謝，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "阿戈爾人，你是來幹嘛的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我在找一種本地流傳的劍術，傳說最早創立這種劍術的……咳咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "幾個月前，我聽說了這種“能與風浪相搏”的特異劍術，想來學習。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "膽子還真大，不知道審判庭的人到今天還戒備著海盜嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我對海盜不感興趣，只是覺得自己的劍術有欠缺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "劍是用來砍人的，不是用來砍水的，更何況，你學會之後要幹嘛？出海嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你問太多了，老伯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉……總有人會相信這種傻事。你要是早來半年，我還能帶你去見見那個老傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他當年跟那群海盜學了一招兩式，天天吵著自己能劈開巨浪。最後還不是跟我一樣，跑回小鎮裡安安穩穩地等死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他死前有留下什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他的日記？都帶進墳墓裡了，自己去挖吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹣跚的老人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那傢伙要是知道有人想學自己的劍術，肯定高興得從墳墓裡爬出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "將鏟子豎在一旁，伊西多掀開棺材板，撥開落入其中的鹽粒，一具外表晶亮、色澤紅潤的屍體露了出來。\n屍體的衣袋中露出書冊的一角。\n伊西多小心翼翼捏住，將它取出，盡全力保護因鹽分侵蝕而異常脆弱的紙張碎片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這就是那位先生說的日記嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "碎得什麼都看不出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳咳……噗——呸呸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……碎紙片都吹進嘴裡了，好鹹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "去別的地方再找找吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別的地方？你這個十惡不赦的盜墓賊、食人犯，還想去哪裡作惡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "盜墓賊？食人犯？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一路上看你鬼鬼祟祟地摸到墓地，現在被我抓到了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我可以解釋，這位先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“這位先生”……？你甚至不認識我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您是當地什麼很有名的人物嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "審判庭教士，平時負責在鎮門口檢查所有來客的通行許可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你不認識我，那你是怎麼進來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "把這個傢伙給我抓起來！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "花瓣碾碎到這種程度就可以了嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "亞諾阿醫生！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞諾阿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，哦！差不多了，再碾幾下就可以加油攪拌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞諾阿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你怎麼手在發抖了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是您眼花了，醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞諾阿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "花什麼生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我說！是您眼花了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞諾阿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，碾花？你不是正在碾花嗎？你看你的手抖成這樣……又偷偷喝酒了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞諾阿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是鎮上的證裁官，最不該喝酒。酒是害人的孽物，這都是你自己布講的教義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "和運酒的商隊代表坐在一張桌子上談生意，總要喝幾杯，都是為了給小鎮謀出路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醫生，那個寡婦的情況怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞諾阿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "誰……大聲一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老陶匠留下的寡婦！這幾天快要生小孩了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞諾阿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "生花籽？啊對，熟了就種不出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我說！\n寡婦！！\n要生小孩！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "西爾弗閣下————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊——！嚇死了，我說過進來之前要敲門的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我聽到您在大叫，以為您遇到了危險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我沒事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那個，除此之外……我還有事要報告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們在鎮東的墳場裡抓到了一個……一個瘋子，一個褻瀆者，正在偷盜鎮民的屍體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這……我以為只要食物充足，當年那樣的慘劇就不會重演。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "西爾弗閣下，抱歉這麼說，但光飽腹是不夠的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當年是您帶來神聖的律法，祛除了人們身負的罪孽。可現在呢？不僅禁令都取消了，連您的布道，我們也很久沒聽過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "罪孽重新滋生，也在所難免。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你這樣認為嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以您絕不能讓這個十惡不赦的褻瀆者在小鎮裡散布罪孽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……安排行刑吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老巴洛呢？有人看到老巴洛和褻瀆者聊了很久……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……不必了。老巴洛年輕的時候是與海盜接觸過，但他沒有為非作歹的膽子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我說，不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "閣下……我認為我們至少有必要盯著他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再說吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "挖墳墓……難道他是想，難道他是想……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇恨的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "罪惡啊！罪惡啊！雅隆不再純潔了……災厄又要降臨了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇恨的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "教士大人，證裁官大人！求你們殺死他，祛除他的罪孽，別讓當年那樣的災禍再度重演！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（扭動）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老實一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "伊西多先生，你深夜出現在墳墓，盜取本鎮居民屍體的事屬實嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不否認出現在墓地，但我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "帕斯卡拉小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "伊西多老兄，想不到你竟然是這種人，偷什麼不好，你去偷屍體？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有點噁心了喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "容我提醒，你的脖子上也戴著枷鎖，帕斯卡拉小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "安靜一點！下一個審的就是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那你為什麼會出現在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我……唉，舊習難改。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼，她正在刑場？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不怪我，是那個丫頭自己的老毛病又犯了，才剛從這道門出去就偷偷跟著一個衣飾華麗的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是證裁官西爾弗啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "以她的身手，就算是證裁官也不可能發現啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "證裁官是沒發現，但卻讓那個過來找證裁官彙報事情的習武教士當場逮到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她在消息裡說的那個煉金術師呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們已經掌握他的位置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在正和帕斯卡拉一起，要被掛上絞刑架了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "刑場一共有幾個習武教士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "十二個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……加上你，人數應該也夠，上吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "女士們先生們，根據本鎮的律例，我們將判處這兩個罪犯絞刑，希望眾人以此為戒，切勿讓不潔的罪行玷污己身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "時間到了，行刑吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你看起來完全不害怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放心好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你有什麼逃生的辦法嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在沒有，但到時候就有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女孩轉過頭，看向絞刑架旁，一位習武教士正要拉動機關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（揮手）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊……我的手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "強、強盜來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，我犯下了怎樣的罪孽，竟要降下此般責罰於我，我應當如何贖罪……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "敵襲！保護在場平民！掩護西爾弗閣下離開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不用管我！先疏散平民！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "懶骨頭們，向前衝！別讓那兩個倒楣蛋死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚎叫的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "衝——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那些強盜是來營救同夥的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "列陣，攔住他們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "舉刀的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "殺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衝動的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們怎敢公然劫掠城鎮？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈維爾，我們在這裡對付他們，你快去救帕斯卡拉和那個小子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "謝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不能讓那些傢伙得逞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "動作快一點，別在這裡浪費太多時間！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有攔路的就砍倒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嚎叫的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快，把他們放下來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猙獰的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿，你們終於來了，快快快，這個鐵鏈栓得我手痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗚啊！我的手腕！這是你們救人的態度嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼，我早就跟首領說過了，你就只會製造麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呿，那你們還不是要來救我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "還有你，走吧，小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可以給我一把劍嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵，接著吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別想走，小子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不能期待我坐以待斃吧，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "劍法不錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂！現在是你們誇獎別人的時候嗎？我們要怎麼離開這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "把嘴閉上跟著蒂奇走，她知道有條小道直通鎮外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小道？那還差不多……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "請吧，諸位！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們往南邊過去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "南邊……？南邊就是懸崖，他們在想什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呼……呼……你瘋了，前面哪裡來的小道？不是懸崖嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "往下跳不就有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，哈維爾，她不是在開玩笑吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "跑快點！不然跳不遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（默默加快速度）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不會打算跟著一起跳吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們難道還有第二條路嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老兄，你這是什麼奇怪的想法啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "前面就到了，一、二、三——跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "決絕的背影向下落去，被帶下去的石塊隨之滾落，片刻後才遙遙傳來落地的悶響。\n帕斯卡拉看著人影與石頭消失在懸崖邊上，緊張得嚥了口吐沫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "前面是死路，他們跑不了了！快追！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快跳，他們要追上來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "帕斯卡拉看了看懸崖，又看了看追上來的習武教士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不——打死我也不跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎，你、你幹嘛？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "將女孩夾在腋下，伊西多回頭看了一眼身後。\n隨後，他果斷轉頭，帶著不停尖叫的女孩躍下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "鱗屎坨子，我絕對不會放過你————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "驚慌間，帕斯卡拉感覺自己落入了柔軟之中，而非自己所預想的堅硬地面。\n睜開眼睛，她發現自己被一張巨大的布料接住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們已經安全了，他們用船帆接住了我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃？懸崖底下……有船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "環顧四周，帕斯卡拉看到龐大的骨骸支撐起了木質的船身，帆布與鱗皮接成的風帆層層疊疊，切碎了日光。\n透過複雜的傳動結構，熾烈的風驅使著船體下繁複的步足，堅定有力地踏過鹽地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就這個膽量，你還自稱神偷嗎，帕斯卡拉小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，當竊賊需要周密的計劃與謹慎的思考，而非莽撞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "蒂奇，別跟那個丫頭費嘴皮子了，快點換套衣服來幫我，舵手剛剛受傷了，你得來接手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "正好，我也嫌那套衣服太拘束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猙獰的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呼……呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？你背著什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猙獰的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "食物和水！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猙獰的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "剛剛看到他們的糧倉，順手拿了一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "猙獰的船員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "走之前再順手放了一把火，哈哈！現在肯定都忙著救火，沒有空管我們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉……混帳小子，幹得不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "姑娘們，小夥子們，再出點力氣！我們明天晚上就到家了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小子，趴在欄杆上看什麼呢？第一次來蒼白海？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這艘船……很奇特。幾乎完全由木材與骨頭組成……應該比一般的陸行艦輕很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "當然，這片鹽漠就只有我們的鹽船可以穿行其中，外面那些沉重的鐵皮怪物，恐怕一進來就會陷下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真是神奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你看起來一點也不害怕。沒聽到小鎮裡的人都怎麼叫我們的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們是強盜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "脫口而出，真是大膽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "將我從絞刑架上救下來的也是你們，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為什麼跟我們一起逃走？這樣的話，在鎮民眼裡，你也是個強盜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……你們知道一種能和海上的風浪搏擊的劍術嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼劍術？你是在開玩笑嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒人知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "從沒聽過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們的艦船會停在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你想離開？恐怕不行，你要和我們一起回到聚落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……抱歉，我沒有這樣的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你怎麼想不重要，小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "請別這麼說，我不想對自己的救命恩人拔劍相向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道你的劍術不錯，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "警覺心就差一點了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘿，我做賊的這幾年，沒有任何一個人能注意到我的動靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這一劑迷煙下去，夠他睡一路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "帕斯卡拉小姐，別太得意。首領要的羅盤在哪裡？為了救你我們花的力氣不少，別讓人失望啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這麼說我就傷心了，我帶給你們的不只有羅盤而已啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（努嘴）不是還有那位老兄嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "加上他的話，你救下我花的力氣就不夠多了，需要再多給一點吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "難道你一張嘴說他是煉金術師，他就是嗎？到了目的地，等首領核實過他的身分再說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "無所謂，該進我口袋裡的東西遲早都會進來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "廚房在哪裡？剛剛死裡逃生，我需要找一點吃的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈維爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "船尾二層。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "謝謝你的慷慨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚恐的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚恐的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只是要把傷口上扎的骨刺挑出來，不會鋸掉你的腿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "究竟是多狠毒的人，才會打造出這種滿是倒刺的刀刃……血已經止住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚恐的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再忍耐一下，我已經派人去請亞諾阿醫生了，等她來了再幫你看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "放心吧，你看起來沒事，多吃幾頓就能恢復了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "證裁官閣下，糧倉的火剛撲滅，裡面什麼都沒剩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……食物的事情我會想辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醫生呢？老人家行動不便，你不扶她過來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醫生她不在了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那她在哪——什麼？怎麼回事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醫生被那些強盜撞倒，敲到後腦勺……人已經不在了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚恐的習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "西爾弗閣下……您……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "弄痛你了嗎……對不起……忍一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要生了，西爾弗大人，寡婦要生了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不知道是不是受了那些強盜的驚嚇，能不能讓醫生先去看看……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……醫生呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別問了，我親自去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不要再晃了，她不會醒來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大人，我……大人，她……大人，孩子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "孩子也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的鎮民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大人，您……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "教士，看好屍體，明早入土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "備好馱獸，葬禮結束之後，你立刻動身去找亞諾阿的兒子，無論如何都要請他回到小鎮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "鎮裡不能沒有醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "習武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "閣下，我記得您跟亞諾阿醫生學過一些醫術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一個剛剛學會做藥膏的人，當不了醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不然，寡婦和孩子也不會死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "去辦吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "透過緊閉的窗，雅隆的人們能看到一抹淡粉紅色的燈火飄過霧氣濃重的街道。\n西爾弗不知道天色是什麼時候暗下來的，他覺得自己方才還迎著朝陽，為當天的行刑儀式整理衣裝。\n此刻卻渾身是血，狼狽得一塌糊塗，不是盜賊與褻瀆者的血，而是鎮民的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "毫無徵兆，在街道另一側，西爾弗瞥見了另一抹淡粉紅色的燈火。\n一個瘦高的男人，腹部有一個血淋淋的洞，西爾弗甚至能透過它看見遠處。\n男人若無其事地向他走來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "先生，請問您需要幫忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您的傷看起來很嚴重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我很好，證裁官先生，您的臉色看起來很差……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安納斯塔西奧",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是新調來的執裁官，請問有什麼能幫忙的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾弗",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "想不到你被倒掛著也能睡得很香，小傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我經常這樣做，也不是很難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你的棚屋已經修好了，記得謝謝哈維爾，為了填補你挖的通道，他一整個晚上都沒睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要放我離開，你們就不必如此麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真是固執，只要羅盤修復成功，你隨時都可以離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我對煉金術一無所知，不管你再問幾次，都是一樣的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "送他回去棚屋，以後去掉他配餐裡的麵包。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
